WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.142
Delta tables add table behavior on top of data files.

00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:12.067
They use a transaction log to track table changes and support more reliable operations than plain collections

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:13.517
of files.

00:00:13.517 --> 00:00:19.707
For this course, the key idea is that Delta tables make lakehouse data easier to query and manage as tables.

00:00:19.707 --> 00:00:24.792
A lakehouse combines scalable file-based storage with table-management features.

00:00:24.792 --> 00:00:33.397
Delta-style tables add transaction logs, schema controls, and reliable table operations on top of object

00:00:33.397 --> 00:00:33.762
storage.

00:00:33.762 --> 00:00:39.617
Keep raw ingestion, cleaned data, and curated analytical tables conceptually separate so lineage remains

00:00:39.617 --> 00:00:41.317
clear.
